* [**Updated**] [EdiZon-Overlay](https://github.com/proferabg/EdiZon-Overlay) — Rebuilt with the latest version of [libultrahand](https://github.com/ppkantorski/libultrahand) (including updated libtesla), the C++26 standard, and the latest libnx toolchain for stable operation on new Atmosphère versions.


