* [**Updated**] [Atmosphere 0411dbf](https://github.com/rashevskyv/Kefirosphere) — Updated Atmosphere
    * [**Details about changes in the original Atmosphere (23_support branch)**](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/commits/23_support)
