* [**Updated**] [TorrentShopNX 2.11](https://github.com/Langegen/TorrentShopNX/releases/tag/2.11) — Fixed shared downloading of selected additional files, added retries for failed downloads, A–Z navigation and developer/publisher search in the catalog, a network inspector, and ZIP archive creation in the file manager.
* [**Updated**] [pipensx 1.6.2](https://github.com/i3sey/pipensx/releases/tag/1.6.2) — When opening Games, today's cached catalog is displayed immediately without re-downloading, while the old list remains visible until the network update is complete.

